{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18107732","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18107732","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1810773201:0":{"text":"我……我的记忆……我想起来了……","source_cn":"我……我的记忆……我想起来了……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x908B0533216FE0CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810773202:0":{"text":"爱丝，瑟恩……抱歉，我竟然忘记了你们……","source_cn":"爱丝，瑟恩……抱歉，我竟然忘记了你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29C782FCB6A1C614","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810773203:0":{"text":"呜呜呜……巴登……","source_cn":"呜呜呜……巴登……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D80F273FBA27C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810773204:1":{"text":"……想起来就好。感觉如何？","source_cn":"……想起来就好。感觉如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA4ECE8010F8FC3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810773205:1":{"text":"身体好像不是自己的，很……冰冷。如果你是指心情……的确有点复杂。","source_cn":"身体好像不是自己的，很……冰冷。如果你是指心情……的确...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1EA0C09F169BC86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810773206:1":